  "finding": "Oceanica now applies a normal continuous field lock using non-negatable global facts for actual Hand/Attack summons, rather than source-local summon-event locks. Facts are recorded before field entry and while source is negated, reset on ordinary card lifecycle, and retain original summon-position qualification across later face-up position changes. Eight actual Normal/Special/field-activation/negation/reentry/Deck-to-Hand cases; exact old source fails5. Off-field/disabled-history/location/position/current-position controls independently fail, and a retained-history-after-leave fault fails original GY-revival regression. Twenty existing named-copy/immunity-expiry/foreign-source/source-negation-restoration/original Harmony followup cases pass against complete current source.",
